SUMMARY:IROS 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:IEEE/RSJ International Conference on Intelligent Robots and Sys
 tems\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-11-14\nOfficial source: https://20
 27.ieee-iros.org/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#ir
 os-2027\nNotes: The official 2027 site and IEEE RAS venues page confirm F
 ortezza da Basso\, Florence\, Sep 27-Oct 1\, 2027 (annual since 1988). As
  of 2026-11-14 no 2027 call is published on 2027.ieee-iros.org (PaperPlaz
 a: 'Submission links will be available soon'). The IEEE RAS events calend
 ar lists the IROS 2027 paper submission deadline as Mar 1\, 2027 (no stat
 ed cutoff hour\; kept estimated until the conference call confirms it). P
 aperPlaza's listing gives Sep 25-30\, 2027\, which conflicts with the off
 icial site and RAS event page (Sep 27-Oct 1)\; the official dates are kep
 t. IROS 2026 was Mar 2 (no hour\; papers could be edited but not started 
 until Mar 5)\; IROS 2023 was Mar 1\, extended to Mar 2. 2026 papers were 
 up to 8 pages\, double-anonymous\, in IEEE Xplore\, with no RA-L+IROS opt
 ion. Non-archival late-breaking posters (2-page abstract\, full registrat
 ion) are not projected\; 2026 pages gave Jul 31 and Aug 10. Size XXL: IRO
 S 2025 had 8\,004 registrants (IEEE RA Magazine). Size is an editorial es
 timate.
CATEGORIES:Control & Robotics,Reinforcement Learning,Computer Vision & Patt
 ern Recognition,Planning & Search
